<title>USA: HarCor Energy stake cut by Centennial.</title>
<headline>HarCor Energy stake cut by Centennial.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Centennial Energy Partners L.P. said Friday it cut its stake in HarCor Energy Inc to 720,000 common shares or 4.76 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 325,000 common shares between $5.4375 to $6.3750 per share.</p>
<p>HarCor, based in Houston, Tx., is engaged in exploring for, acquiring interests in and developing on-shore oil and gas properties.</p>
</text>
